WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:13,920
Do you have the methylated B vitamins at home?

00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:17,920
So, let's go to this slide here.

00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:32,920
So, methylated B vitamins would be five methyl tetrahydrovolate,

00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:46,380
or it would be, or I should say, methyl cobalamine.

00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:56,380
If you have those products at home, so five methyl tetrahydrovolate is your methylated folate,

00:00:56,380 --> 00:01:01,380
and methyl cobalamine is your methylated B12.

00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:04,380
We just want to start taking some of that.

00:01:04,380 --> 00:01:18,380
And you should start at, make sure you're taking, I would say, less than one gram of this per day.

00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:20,380
Oops.

00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:27,380
So, if it's 500 milligrams, or 1000 milligrams, don't take any more than that.

00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:32,380
There are some supplements on the market that are like five grams of methyl tetrahydrofolate,

00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:35,380
do not start with something like that.

00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:41,380
Taking too much methyl tetrahydrofolate will push a different pathway called the biopterate pathway,

00:01:41,380 --> 00:01:43,380
really, really hard.

00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:50,380
And if you have any defects in the biopterate pathway, you're going to have some emotional issues,

00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:55,380
because you can create way too much serotonin.

00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:57,380
That's the most common thing.

00:01:57,380 --> 00:02:04,380
And then you get some rage issues, and we don't want you beating anybody up or hurting your spouse.

00:02:04,380 --> 00:02:13,380
So, methyl cobalamine, there's really no upper limit on this within reason.

00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:16,380
So any of the supplements that are out there with the methyl cobalamine,

00:02:17,380 --> 00:02:20,380
what's on the bottle for that?

00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:26,380
Make sure you don't take it any more than one gram of the methyl tetrahydrofolate.

